# Source media, kept out of the repository: 221 MB of inputs that have already
# been consumed by the generators. What the experiment needs at runtime is
# stimuli/ (embedded into the binary) and the small derived assets, both of
# which are tracked.
#
# Keep local copies if you want to re-run split-sheets.py or
# natural_sounds/make-sound-clips.py; nothing else depends on them.
assets/faces/*.jpeg
assets/houses/*.jpeg
assets/natural_sounds/*
!assets/natural_sounds/sound_*.wav
!assets/natural_sounds/make-sound-clips.py
!assets/natural_sounds/README.txt

# R session leftovers
.RData
.Rhistory
